{"ticker":"CME","updated":"2026-10-30T22:40:50Z","profile":{"longName":"CME Group Inc.","shortName":"CME Group Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cmegroup.com","fullTimeEmployees":3875,"marketCap":108504080384,"trailingPE":24.847542,"forwardPE":22.911432,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":15.598407,"pegRatio":4.09,"targetMeanPrice":317.0625,"targetHighPrice":367.0,"targetLowPrice":227.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.13,"earningsGrowth":0.161,"grossMargins":1.0,"operatingMargins":0.65850997,"profitMargins":0.63482,"totalRevenue":6956100096,"beta":0.27,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":329.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":218.31,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.75},"summary":"CME Group Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates contract markets for the trading of futures and options on futures contracts worldwide. It offers futures and options products based on interest rates, equity indexes, and foreign exchange; and agricultural, energy, and metals commodities, as well as fixed income and foreign currency trading services. The company provides clearing house services, including clearing, settling, and guaranteeing futures and options contracts, and cleared swaps products traded through its exchanges. In addition, the company offers a range of market data services, including real-time and historical data services. It serves professional traders, financial institutions, institutional and individual investors, corporations, manufacturers, producers, governments, and central banks. CME Group Inc. partners with FutureSports to futures on sports indexes. The company was formerly known as Chicago Mercantile Exchange Holdings Inc. and changed its name to CME Group Inc. in July 2007. The company was founded in 1898 and is headquartered in Chicago, Illinois.","summary_zh":"芝商所及其子公司在全球範圍內營運期貨和期貨合約選擇權交易的合約市場。它提供基於利率、股票指數和外匯的期貨和選擇權產品；農業、能源和金屬商品，以及固定收益和外幣交易服務。該公司提供清算所服務，包括清算、結算和擔保期貨和選擇權合約，以及透過其交易所交易的清算掉期產品。此外，該公司還提供一系列市場數據服務，包括即時和歷史數據服務。它為專業交易員、金融機構、機構和個人投資者、公司、製造商、生產商、政府和中央銀行提供服務。 CME Group Inc. 與 FutureSports 合作開發體育指數期貨。該公司前身為芝加哥商業交易所控股公司，2007年7月更名為芝商所集團公司。該公司成立於1898年，總部位於伊利諾州芝加哥。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"財務數據和證券交易所","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":266.88,"h":268.06,"l":262.55,"c":265.4,"v":2847300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":265.4,"h":269.77,"l":264.15,"c":269.35,"v":2386500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":269.58,"h":271.6,"l":266.95,"c":267.43,"v":1891400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":265.71,"h":266.04,"l":260.58,"c":261.94,"v":1633900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":261.61,"h":262.67,"l":258.51,"c":262.58,"v":1973600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":260.97,"h":263.2,"l":260.46,"c":261.53,"v":1969100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":261.0,"h":261.36,"l":258.79,"c":259.91,"v":1722300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":260.74,"h":262.64,"l":259.57,"c":262.38,"v":1955300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":261.89,"h":263.62,"l":260.31,"c":262.3,"v":1565500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":262.23,"h":264.43,"l":258.31,"c":258.83,"v":1820400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":258.44,"h":262.42,"l":257.88,"c":259.83,"v":1992700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":260.95,"h":263.02,"l":260.35,"c":262.4,"v":1554000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":262.0,"h":263.09,"l":259.32,"c":260.59,"v":1890200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":261.64,"h":263.33,"l":259.36,"c":261.53,"v":3143900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":260.75,"h":263.85,"l":259.17,"c":261.08,"v":1143000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":261.1,"h":262.62,"l":259.31,"c":261.96,"v":1098700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":262.16,"h":264.83,"l":260.77,"c":264.43,"v":1405200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":265.61,"h":271.22,"l":264.74,"c":268.73,"v":2367100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":270.81,"h":271.35,"l":268.37,"c":270.28,"v":1534800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":271.27,"h":272.4,"l":269.63,"c":272.24,"v":1397500},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":272.84,"h":274.17,"l":269.5,"c":270.19,"v":2893700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":270.19,"h":270.52,"l":264.1,"c":265.84,"v":2308900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":264.54,"h":266.03,"l":26