S AND OILSEED PRODUCTS","src":"CME Group","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9vTVo0MlZvdFhKSmpLQlVucjB1aGlDMFF1LWlNVFJUOHdPejBYM1pLd012ZFBtbVhpU0tfT1c2TWc0cUxqek5Ld0ZKQlc1cWJwbzZfa1doaDVqNUI3ejBINEVCaTdXX1hFQ1Njanpadw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"與穀物和油籽產品做市公司聯繫"}],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":5},{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-26","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1156375/000115637526000009/cme-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"CME Group enables clients to trade futures, options, cash and over-the-counter (OTC) products, optimize portfolios and analyze data - empowering market participants worldwide to efficiently manage risk and capture opportunities. CME Group provides primary price discovery and referential pricing information through its market data in a variety of formats, including real-time, historical and derived data for customers in both listed and cash products. CME Group also offers industry-leading research and analytics tools to provide customers with market education resources. In addition, it operates one of the world's leading central counterparty clearing providers.","zh":"芝商所使客戶能夠交易期貨、選擇權、現金和場外交易 (OTC) 產品，優化投資組合併分析數據，從而使全球市場參與者能夠有效管理風險並抓住機會。芝商所透過多種格式的市場數據提供主要價格發現和參考定價資訊，包括為客戶提供上市產品和現金產品的即時數據、歷史數據和派生數據。芝商所也提供業界領先的研究和分析工具，為客戶提供市場教育資源。此外，它還經營著世界領先的中央對手方清算提供者之一。"},{"en":"Our principal executive offices are located at 20 South Wacker Drive, Chicago, Illinois 60606, our telephone number is 312-930-1000 and our website is cmegroup.com.","zh":"我們的主要執行辦公室位於 20 South Wacker Drive, Chicago, IL 60606，電話號碼為 312-930-1000，網址為 cmegroup.com。"},{"en":"CME Group exchanges offer the widest range of global benchmark products across interest rates, equity indexes, foreign exchange (FX), and agricultural, energy and metals commodities. We also offer cash and repo fixed income trading via BrokerTec, and spot and OTC FX trading via EBS. Additionally, we operate one of the world's leading central counterparty clearing providers.","zh":"芝商所集團交易所提供最廣泛的全球基準產品，涵蓋利率、股票指數、外匯 (FX) 以及農產品、能源和金屬商品。我們也透過 BrokerTec 提供現金和回購固定收益交易，並透過 EBS 提供現貨和場外外匯交易。此外，我們還經營著世界領先的中央對手方清算提供者之一。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"U.S. trading rights and privileges are exchange-specific. Open outcry trading is conducted exclusively by our members. Membership on one of our derivatives exchanges also enables a customer to trade specific products at lower fees. Under the terms of the organizational documents of our exchanges, our members have certain rights that relate primarily to trading right protections, certain trading fee protections and certain membership benefit protections. In 2025, 85% of our contract volume was from trades by our members.","zh":"美國的貿易權利和特權是特定於交易所的。公開喊價交易僅由我們的會員進行。我們的衍生性商品交易所之一的會員資格也使客戶能夠以較低的費用交易特定產品。根據我們交易所的組織文件條款，我們的會員擁有某些權利，主要涉及交易權保護、某些交易費用保護和某些會員福利保護。 2025 年，我們 85% 的合約量來自會員的交易。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The industry in which we operate is highly competitive and has seen multiple new entrants over time, and we expect competition to continue to intensify and become more global, especially in light of changes in the financial services industry driven by regulatory reforms such as the Dodd-Frank Wall Street Reform and Consumer Protection Act (Dodd-Frank), European Market Infrastructure Regulation (EMIR), EMIR 3.0, Markets in Financial Instruments Directive II (MiFID II), Capital Requirements Directive IV, Market Abuse Regulation, Benchmarks Regulation, Basel III and various other laws and regulations.","zh":"我們所在的行業競爭激烈，隨著時間的推移出現了多個新進入者，我們預計競爭將繼續加劇並變得更加全球化，特別是考慮到監管改革推動的金融服務行業的變化，例如《多德-弗蘭克華爾街改革和消費者保護法案》(Dodd-Frank)、歐洲市場基礎設施​​規定(EMIR)、EMIR 3.0、金融工具市場法規要求、巴塞爾政策、其他市場基礎設施​​、法律法規、其他法律法規、巴塞爾法規、其他市場法規（CIV II）。"},{"en":"Please also refer to the discussion below and in \"Item 1A - Risk Factors\" beginning on page 16 for a description of competitive risks and uncertainties.","zh":"另請參閱下面的討論以及第 16 頁開始的“第 1A 項 - 風險因素”，以了解競爭風險和不確定性的描述。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Clearingandtransactionfees","val":5281100000,"zh":"清算及交易費用"},{"name":"Market Data","val":803100000,"zh":"市場數據"},{"name":"Other Revenue","val":436400000,"zh":"其他收入"}],"total":6520600000}},"peers":["ICE","CBOE","NDAQ","SPGI","MCO"]}}